              "content": "/* ==========================================================================\n   gh-portfolio — \"Terminal Aurora\" design\n   Dark-first: deep slate surface, indigo→cyan aurora accent, mono numerals.\n   Light: warm paper with the same accent ink. System font stack only.\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n  --font-sans: \"Inter\", \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: ui-monospace, \"JetBrains Mono\", \"Cascadia Code\", \"SF Mono\", Consolas, monospace;\n\n  --radius-lg: 18px;\n  --radius-md: 12px;\n  --radius-sm: 8px;\n\n  --accent: #6366f1;\n  --accent-2: #22d3ee;\n  --accent-gradient: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));\n  --focus-ring: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 45%, transparent);\n\n  --transition: 180ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n}\n\nhtml[data-theme=\"dark\"] {\n  color-scheme: dark;\n  --bg: #0b1220;\n  --bg-glow: radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 80% -10%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.16), transparent 60%),\n            radial-gradient(800px 400px at 10% 110%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.10), transparent 60%);\n  --surface: rgba(23, 33, 54, 0.72);\n  --surface-solid: #172136;\n  --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16);\n  --text: #e6edf7;\n  --text-muted: #8b9bb4;\n  --chip-bg: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.14);\n  --chip-text: #b3baff;\n  --skeleton: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);\n  --skeleton-shine: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);\n  --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(2, 6, 18, 0.45);\n}\n\nhtml[data-theme=\"light\"] {\n  color-scheme: light;\n  --bg: #f7f6f2;\n  --bg-glow: radial-gradient(900px 450px at 85% -10%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.10), transparent 60%),\n            radial-gradient(700px 350px at 5% 110%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08), transparent 60%);\n  --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);\n  --surface-solid: #ffffff;\n  --border: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.12);\n  --text: #1c2436;\n  --text-muted: #5b6879;\n  --chip-bg: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.10);\n  --chip-text: #4b4fc4;\n  --skeleton: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);\n  --skeleton-shine: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.14);\n  --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(28, 36, 54, 0.10);\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nhtml { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100dvh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: var(--bg-glow);\n  background-attachment: fixed;\n  transition: background-color var(--transition), color var(--transition);\n}\n\n.container {\n  width: min(1060px, 100% - 2.5rem);\n  margin-inline: auto;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 1.75rem;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.visually-hidden {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px; height: 1px;\n  margin: -1px; padding: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0 0 0 0);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n.skip-link {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -48px; left: 1rem;\n  z-index: 100;\n  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: top var(--transition);\n}\n.skip-link:focus { top: 0.75rem; }\n\n/* Focus states ----------------------------------------------------------- */\n:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  box-shadow: var(--focus-ring);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n/* Top bar ----------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.topbar {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 10;\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 78%, transparent);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.topbar-inner, .topbar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 1rem;\n  padding: 0.9rem max(1.25rem, calc((100vw - 1060px) / 2));\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.55